62#page=5", "transcript_pages": [3862, 3864, 3865, 3866, 3867, 3868, 3869, 3870], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE686A1CED547AEAFFEA02DB9637356654940C9B5D35507F7E093B58383F99E8F8D59AA1D6D277C8A3BA852238F00A7C162", "videos": [{"date": "2023-10-19", "group": 4}]}, {"dates": ["2023-11-09"], "dept": "工務", "doc_type": "部門質詢", "group": 2, "heading": "工務部門質詢第2組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE640660B60D06DFB92A02DB963735665494D7A5BFDCDAE88110FC6B0F52727A1827578A7E841996F11A852238F00A7C162#page=1", "transcript_pages": [5782, 5783, 5784, 5785, 5786, 5787, 5788, 5789, 5790, 5791, 5792], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE640660B60D06DFB92A02DB963735665494D7A5BFDCDAE88110FC6B0F52727A1827578A7E841996F11A852238F00A7C162", "videos": [{"date": "2023-11-09", "group": 2}]}, {"dates": ["2023-11-16"], "dept": "民政", "doc_type": "部門質詢", "group": 1, "heading": "民政部門質詢第1組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549E39796C9075EC2818D9DD67FAF8F47C8ED5476E330221E65A852238F00A7C162#page=6", "transcript_pages": [14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549E39796C9075EC2818D9DD67FAF8F47C8ED5476E330221E65A852238F00A7C162", "videos": [{"date": "2023-11-16", "group": 1}]}], "status": "ok"}','https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB9637356654962A2FC1C7EA39421941941C3B6562A8BA9136CF3D8176C9CA852238F00A7C162','2026-10-05T06:02:50Z');
INSERT INTO "fact" VALUES('summary:14-02:p3d9ce55419','p3d9ce55419','summary','2023-12-07','{"disclaimer": "質詢摘要為AI產出，僅供參考用途，詳細事實以原質詢速記錄與影片為準", "generated_at": "2026-10-05T06:04:38Z", "generator": "NotebookLM", "issues": [{"citations": [{"page": 535, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=19"}, {"page": 535, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=19"}, {"page": 5542, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC#page=5"}, {"page": 538, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=22"}, {"page": 5543, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC#page=6"}, {"page": 5546, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC#page=9"}, {"page": 537, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=21"}, {"page": 539, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=23"}, {"page": 537, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=21"}, {"page": 5544, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC#page=7"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出臺北市機車停車格位不足，質疑市府在機車灣設置自行車腳架及電池交換站減少停車供給，且「機退2.0」缺乏事前評估與停車衝擊解決策略。鍾佩玲議員詢問「機退2.0」推動後全臺北市會減少多少停車格，並要求市府提出具體改善規劃與承諾不調漲停車費。"], "response": "市長表示政策方向原則上以停放機車為主，未來不會在機車灣增設自行車架或電池交換站等設施，且明年原則上不會調漲停車費及擴大收費範圍。停車管理工程處處長說明機退2.0希望維持至少七成替代空間，粗估34條主要幹道實施後約減少三成即1,500格機車格，市府會透過尋找畸零地或開闢停車場等方式補足。交通局局長表示會於總質詢前提供相關統計數字與解決對策。", "response_removed": false, "topic": "機車停車格位劃設與機退2.0配套規劃"}, {"citations": [{"page": 530, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=14"}, {"page": 531, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=15"}, {"page": 530, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=14"}, {"page": 531, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=15"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出新北市宣稱年底動工卻遲至翌年2月才提交維計畫，要求市府堅持必須通過交維計畫才能動工，不可犧牲臺北市民權益。鍾佩玲議員並指出市府對北投區19位里長僅面訪4位且多採電訪，要求市府一週內函文新北市及即刻召開座談會與里長溝通。"], "response": null, "response_removed": true, "topic": "淡北道路交通維持計畫與地方溝通"}, {"citations": [{"page": 1496, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=8"}, {"page": 1497, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=9"}, {"page": 1499, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=11"}, {"page": 1500, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=12"}, {"page": 1497, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=9"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出臺北市列管飲水機場域有2,120處，但每年僅抽查360處，且稽查過度集中於捷運站與公園，甚至有飲水機檢測報告停留在4年前。鍾佩玲議員要求環保局核實列管名冊正確性、納入中央部會與派出所等場域，並研擬自主管理與自治條例規範。"], "response": "環境保護局局長承認現行稽查頻率與量能確實不足，說明因人力有限，正規劃於明年上半年實施自主提報系統。環境保護局水質病媒管制科科長說明截至10月底已查核667家，並已將3年內未稽查場域納入。", "response_removed": false, "topic": "公共場域飲水機水質抽查與列管管理"}, {"citations": [{"page": 528, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=12"}, {"page": 527, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=11"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出臺北市人口最多與最少的里相差10倍，但里鄰建設經費僅相差10萬元，且預算上限30萬元自民國98年起已15年未調整，遠低於新北市與桃園市的60萬元。鍾佩玲議員強調僅調整級距無法解決大里受限於40萬元天花板的問題，要求市府調高經費上限。"], "response": null, "response_removed": true, "topic": "里鄰建設與睦鄰活動經費分配金額"}, {"citations": [{"page": 271, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549A9172A05E789C591D96F00F4A8D98CD2EC3FF09E18FFB2CEA852238F00A7C162#page=6"}, {"page": 271, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549A9172A05E789C591D96F00F4A8D98CD2EC3FF09E18FFB2CEA852238F00A7C162#page=6"}, {"page": 272, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549A9172A05E789C591D96F00F4A8D98CD2EC3FF09E18FFB2CEA852238F00A7C162#page=7"}, {"page": 272, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549A9172A05E789C591D96F00F4A8D98CD2EC3FF09E18FFB2CEA852238F00A7C162#page=7"}, {"page": 273, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE67DBC80F76A9CB0B0A02DB96373566549A9172A05E789C591D96F00F4A8D98CD2EC3FF09E18FFB2CEA852238F00A7C162#page=8"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出好孕專車合作醫療院所各區數量懸殊，審核時間長達14個工作日，且系統收到約300件反映，其中75件涉及系統不穩定、重複扣款或扣款失敗等問題。鍾佩玲議員要求社會局縮短審核流程、改善台北通系統扣款故障，並優先調派無菸專車。"], "response": "社會局局長說明點數可使用至產後6個月，預計年底3,900萬元預算足夠，並表示審查時間可縮短至7個工作日，亦會要求車隊調派時以無菸專車優先。資訊局數位企劃中心主任表示收到通知後已積極找出原因，系統異常狀況已有減少。", "response_removed": false, "topic": "好孕專車乘車補助與服務優化"}, {"citations": [{"page": 4043, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE686A1CED547AEAFFEA02DB963735665495C91768A851F3EB58338CDD5CEF19D06B6D58C6F8A0689C4A852238F00A7C162#page=7"}, {"page": 4045, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE686A1CED547AEAFFEA02DB963735665495C91768A851F3EB58338CDD5CEF19D06B6D58C6F8A0689C4A852238F00A7C162#page=9"}, {"page": 4045, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE686A1CED547AEAFFEA02DB963735665495C91768A851F3EB58338CDD5CEF19D06B6D58C6F8A0689C4A852238F00A7C162#page=9"}, {"page": 4044, "source_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE686A1CED547AEAFFEA02DB963735665495C91768A851F3EB58338CDD5CEF19D06B6D58C6F8A0689C4A852238F00A7C162#page=8"}], "councilor_points": ["鍾佩玲議員指出吉祥物熊讚出席活動僅收取少量費用，卻在大稻埕夏日節等活動自掏腰包支應近500萬元，甚至出資200萬元卻未在宣傳海報上露出，質疑市府將其當成提款機。鍾佩玲議員並指出翌年熊讚維運預算由1,000萬元砍半至500萬元，要求觀光傳播局檢討動支情形與預算編列合理性。"], "response": "觀光傳播局局長說明係藉由活動行銷熊讚形象，針對不足之處會檢討改善，並表示預算運用會更加謹慎。觀光傳播局科長說明大稻埕夏日節現場有進行宣傳活動，預算支用事前均有進行規劃。", "response_removed": false, "topic": "城市吉祥物「熊讚」行銷費用與預算編列"}], "session": "第14屆第2次定期大會", "sources": [{"dates": ["2023-12-01"], "dept": null, "doc_type": "市政總質詢", "group": 13, "heading": "市政總質詢第13組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162#page=10", "transcript_pages": [526, 527, 528, 529, 530, 531, 532, 533, 534, 535, 536, 537, 538, 539, 540, 541], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE641DE345F6C1C5B07A02DB963735665493CCA1284E6E7B42BD5B16720985F30BE1E66A42DFA5A802DA852238F00A7C162", "videos": [{"date": "2023-12-01", "group": 13}]}, {"dates": ["2023-10-26"], "dept": "交通", "doc_type": "部門質詢", "group": 5, "heading": "交通部門質詢第5組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC#page=1", "transcript_pages": [5538, 5539, 5540, 5541, 5542, 5543, 5544, 5545, 5546, 5547], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE6A94044FCF1E14CADA02DB96373566549E48956289EAF6FAA62B74DFE80EC498C711762A48C5CDD733A00BEF038B0EA7A02D1DE3DCEB210BC", "videos": [{"date": "2023-10-26", "group": 5}]}, {"dates": ["2023-11-07"], "dept": "警政衛生", "doc_type": "部門質詢", "group": 17, "heading": "警政衛生部門質詢第17組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162#page=8", "transcript_pages": [1496, 1497, 1498, 1499, 1500, 1501], "transcript_url": "https://gaz.tcc.gov.tw/pdf/viewer.html?id=EA46139178DD3AE65BB10AA629AB0925A02DB96373566549466673D6FECE90401C33171658E5A47EB94611A09298EFADA852238F00A7C162", "videos": [{"date": "2023-11-07", "group": 17}]}, {"dates": ["2023-10-12"], "dept": "財政建設", "doc_type": "部門質詢", "group": 3, "heading": "財政建設部門質詢第3組", "transcript_page_url": "https://gaz.tcc.go